(The bare, unsupervised `tokio::spawn` in `tests/g2_mutation_temp.rs` for
this run is the one gated OFF by leaving `G2_MUTATION_BARE_SPAWN` unset --
`src/ws_repackager.rs`'s own injected panic was deliberately LEFT IN for
this run, unmodified, since the whole point is proving the *supervised*
pattern recovers from the exact same panic.)

